  ('cc', 'cc.amount_conditional_approval_matrix_78', 'Amount-conditional approval matrix', 'amount', 'som', 'Vizyon 20-cc#78. The full amount-band → required-approver-level tier table. ''≤500ming→boshliq'' is only a partial example (''...''); owner must supply every band and its approver level.'),
