  ('crm', 'crm.advance_flag_gate_before_pp_119', 'Advance flag+% gate before PP', 'percent', '%', 'Vizyon 13-crm#119. The minimum-advance % threshold that unblocks PP handoff (owner policy value). 70% is a candidate from the existing order->dept fan-out rule but is unconfirmed for the CRM deal->PP gate.'),
