  ('marketing', 'marketing.lead_ar_payment_discipline_badge_1469', 'Lead AR payment-discipline badge (AR debt)', 'days', 'kun', 'Vizyon 14-marketing#14-69. Exact overdue-days threshold + display rules for the ''to''lov kechikmoqda'' badge (decision:656). openDebt data is available; only the threshold/display policy is missing.'),
